        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Early Childhood Longitudinal Study, Kindergarten Class of 2010-11 (ECLS-K:2011)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "ECLS-K:2011 follows a nationally representative kindergarten cohort from 2010 through fifth grade. It supports weighted descriptive and developmental context; it does not by itself estimate an initiative’s effect.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://nces.ed.gov/ecls/",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "bb3cefc2ff2041edb3527864b04ae1f7"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "ECLS-K:2011 catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** National Center for Education Statistics.\n- **Access:** Public-use child-level files, documentation, and setup files; restricted files require a license.\n- **Unit:** Longitudinal child record with linked family, teacher, classroom, and school responses.\n- **Coverage:** Kindergarten entry in 2010 through spring 2016 fifth grade for the ECLS-K:2011 cohort.\n- **Geography:** Nation.\n- **Join keys:** Child record, wave, respondent type, and survey weight.\n- **Measures:** Direct assessments, school readiness, child development, family background, and classroom and school context.\n- **Appropriate uses:** Early-childhood outcome context, developmental trajectories, and program-participation context.\n\nUse NCES weights and cohort-specific comparability guidance. ECLS-K:2011 is observational longitudinal data, so it cannot substitute for an experimental or otherwise credible evaluation of an early-childhood initiative.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
